      "category": "team",
      "content": "A XSS vulnerability was found in the username field of one of our sign-up pages (https://www.formassembly.com/partners/salesforce/sign-up.php?plan=PROFESSIONAL). The researcher was able to prompt an alert by posting this code in the field: \"><img src=x onerror=alert(document.domain)>\n\nThis issue was corrected and we thank the researcher, @bogdantcaciuc for his contributions to our site's security. ",
